B.aBA=new A.cB("The Age of Voices","Long, long ago","Every word spoken in Africa was a living light. The griots kept those lights in the Tree of Voices, a baobab so old its roots touched every language, from the Sahel to the Cape.")
B.aBC=new A.cB("The Night of Forgetting","Many lifetimes later","People grew busy. Grandmothers' stories went untold, and children stopped asking what words meant. Every forgotten story soured into a shadow.")
B.aBy=new A.cB("The Rise of the Shadows","Not so long ago","From the forgotten stories rose the Evil Spirits: Shadow Wraiths, Spirit Bats, Forest Phantoms and the Ancient Guardians. They serve Kivuli, the Shadow King, who wants a world without words.")
B.aBB=new A.cB("The Shattering","Last full moon","Kivuli struck the Tree of Voices. Its Word Stones scattered across six lands, and languages everywhere began to fade.")
B.aBn=new A.cB("Zuba's Calling","Today",'In a small village, a curious pup named Zuba found the last glowing seed of the Tree. Mama Ayo, the old griot, gave him the Staff of Voices, the Boomerang of Return, the Shield of the Ancestors and the Power Amulet. "A word remembered is a light that cannot be put out."')
B.aBu=new A.cB("The Six Lands","Your journey","Through the Whispering Forest, the Baobab Plains, the Village of Drums, the Sacred Grove, the Falls of Echoes and the Shadow Realm, Zuba gathers Word Stones and frees the restless spirits.")
B.aBz=new A.cB("The New Moon","Forever","Even after Kivuli falls, forgotten stories keep making new shadows. Every new moon the spirits return stronger, so the journey never ends. Keep speaking. Keep learning.")
